# What EAS must NOT upload when it archives this project.
#
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore — not in addition to it.
# So it has to repeat everything in .gitignore that must stay out of the archive, and then add
# the extra backstops. If you add a rule to .gitignore that matters for the build, mirror it here.

# --- dependencies & build output (EAS installs and builds these itself) ---
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
.metro-health-check*
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- generated native folders (EAS prebuilds them) ---
/ios
/android
.kotlin/

# --- signing material & local env: must never leave this machine ---
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.pem
.env*.local

# --- size backstop -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Founder rule, 2026-08-17: nothing staged Future may take up space in the build. The Buddy
# 3D assets that made the first archive huge now live in 12_Future_Assets/, outside app/.
# These patterns stop a stray heavy 3D/art source file from silently re-inflating the upload.
# If the shipping app ever genuinely needs one of these formats, delete its line deliberately
# rather than working around it.
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.blend
*.psd

# --- noise ---
.DS_Store
*.orig.*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
